13. Remix Form data handling with Loader and Actions for Shopify app
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WyGN5CT9iCs&list=PLB4AdipoHpxZu39dNjUWGRwgeKgW7mVJ-&index=13

- Tạo setting page với 2 field: app name va description
Su dung pattern: App settings page (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WyGN5CT9iCs&list=PLB4AdipoHpxZu39dNjUWGRwgeKgW7mVJ-&index=13)
- Viết thêm code để lưu trữ và hiển thị giá trị của các field trong form:
    onChange, setState,...
- Viết Các function: Loader, Action để xử lý form data
    (https://remix.run/docs/en/main/discussion/data-flow)
- To submit form, need to add Form to the component

14. How to handle API requests in Remix App POST, PATCH, DELETE
- copy the application_url in shopify.app.toml to browser
if you want to use {{application_url}}/api/wishlist, create file api.wishlist.jsx in the routes folder
https://ko-units-dependent-lived.trycloudflare.com/api/wishlist

=> it will run GET method as default => require function loader()
=> If you want to use POST method => require function action()
=> You can try on the Postman

15. Shopify Remix app Database structure
- Khai bao table structure trong file prisma/schema.prisma 
- Sau đó cần chạy lệnh sau để generate prima migrations: 
    npm run prisma migrate dev -- --name {{migration_name}}
    {{migration_name}} sẽ được hiển thị ở file trong thư mục migrations

- Sau khi generate, có thể chạy lệnh sau để kiểm tra database, các bảng
    npm run prisma studio
- https://www.prisma.io/docs/orm/prisma-client/queries/crud
- https://www.prisma.io/docs/orm/reference/prisma-client-reference

- // Because settings is not an object, we need to convert it to object
  settings = Object.fromEntries(settings)